    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As pilot of the mining vessel Solon, you are the Celestian's last hope to construct the Galactic Ring - a colossal gateway to escape a ravaged galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your ship with a variety of tools and blast asteroids, resist radioactive clouds and derelict defenses, and dismantle ancient wrecks to gather enough materials for the construction of your civilization's final chance at survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your partner, the autonomous mothership Asteria, will support your efforts as you piece together the truth behind the Celestians' extinction. Not all secrets of the Eventide Crystals were meant to be uncovered.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As pilot of the mining vessel Solon, you are the Celestian's last hope to construct the Galactic Ring - a colossal gateway to escape a ravaged galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your ship with a variety of tools and blast asteroids, resist radioactive clouds and derelict defenses, and dismantle ancient wrecks to gather enough materials for the construction of your civilization's final chance at survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your partner, the autonomous mothership Asteria, will support your efforts as you piece together the truth behind the Celestians' extinction. Not all secrets of the Eventide Crystals were meant to be uncovered.</p>",
